{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "952b852e-f62f-8a96-a814-c23a9d702be7",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T13:16:53-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:14:54-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:14:58-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Please, I would like to report a problem in the road. A manhole cover has sunk down, and it rings, a loud bang, every time a car goes over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:10-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sunken manhole cover. Got it. Where's it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:14-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, it is at 446 Ocean Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side, right in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:21-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "446 Ocean Avenue. Okay, writing that down. Is it in the travel lane or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:28-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, one moment. It is right in the bike lane. A bicycle could hit it very badly. The edge is lower than the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:37-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good for a bike. Has it been like that a while, or is this new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:44-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It began after the rain on Friday and Saturday, three days ago. Before, it was only a little low. Now it is much worse and very loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:15:54-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That tracks, the wet ground can shift things. Alright, so sunken manhole cover, bike lane, 446 Ocean Avenue, rings when cars cross. I'll put it in for a crew to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:05-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Kevin. Please, may I have a reference number for the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:11-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on a sec while it saves. [pause] Okay, your reference number is 4417. Got a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:18-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one moment, please. Thank you, Kelvin. Can you say the number again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:23-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Kevin, with a V, no worries. Four, four, one, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forgive me, Kevin. Four, four, one, seven. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:32-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Want me to take a callback number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:39-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:42-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0164. Perfect. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:45-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your help, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:16:51-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, take care."
    }
  ],
